    <item>
      <title>伊朗在其代理人的帮助下策划了更广泛的战争</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/iran-proxies-war-oil.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在短暂的休战期间，伊朗人秘密制定了一项计划，如果美军再次发动攻击，将增加特朗普总统的战争成本。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/iran-proxies-war-oil.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 16:42:34 GMT</pubDate>
